 "name_en": "Order-to-Cash Performance Monitoring (BKN)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Order-to-Cash Performance Monitoring (BKN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio35f13ff3fc9b4003bb62e7bd6f39d1fd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio35f13ff3fc9b4003bb62e7bd6f39d1fd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item provides apps that provide you, as a manager or owner of a company's order-to-cash processes, a comprehensive overview of the performance and conformity of all the sales order processes in your company.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio35f13ff3fc9b4003bb62e7bd6f39d1fd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Display average order-to-cash lead times (such as the order to invoice lead time, or unblocking time of sales orders) for the current period (preconfigured as 28 days) and time series for the last 12 months</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display totals for the order-to-cash process (such as number of critical field changes) for the current period (preconfigured as 28 days) and time series for the last 12 months</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Drill down the KPIs according to business attributes, such as sales organization, distribution channel, division, customer, and material.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Drill down to sales orders and display the processing history of the sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display aggregated process flows according to business attributes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Share process KPI and process information with person responsible for process execution in a sales organization</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio35f13ff3fc9b4003bb62e7bd6f39d1fd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Gain strategic and operational control over end-to-end performance of order-to-cash processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">View current status and trends in the performance of your sales process for different phases of the sales processes: order processing, order delivery, and order billing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Benchmark across a number of business attributes, such as sales organization, distribution channel, division, customer, and material</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Identify bottlenecks and areas of improvement by comparing aggregated views of your current and past processes</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>从订单到收款绩效监控 (BKN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio35f13ff3fc9b4003bb62e7bd6f39d1fd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio35f13ff3fc9b4003bb62e7bd6f39d1fd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目提供的应用作为公司订单到收款流程的经理或所有者，为您提供公司中所有销售订单流程的绩效和一致性的全面概览。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio35f13ff3fc9b4003bb62e7bd6f39d1fd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">显示当前期间（预配置为 28 天）和过去 12 个月时间序列的平均订单到收款提前期（例如订单到发票提前期或销售订单的取消冻结时间）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示当前期间（预配置为 28 天）和过去 12 个月时间序列的订单到收款流程的总计（例如关键字段更改数）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据业务属性（如销售组织、分销渠道、产品组、客户和物料）下钻 KPI。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">下钻到销售订单，并显示销售订单的处理历史记录</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据业务属性显示汇总的流程流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">与销售组织中负责流程执行的人员共享流程 KPI 和流程信息</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio35f13ff3fc9b4003bb62e7bd6f39d1fd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">对订单到收款流程的端到端绩效进行战略和运营控制。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看不同阶段销售流程销售流程绩效的当前状态和趋势：订单处理、订单交货和订单开票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">跨多个业务属性（如销售组织、分销渠道、产品组、客户和物料）进行基准</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过比较当前和过去流程的汇总视图，确定瓶颈和改进领域</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
